    // Ship – simple triangle with gradient
    ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);
    // Ship – simple triangle with gradient
    ctx.fillStyle = 'cyan';
    ctx.beginPath();
    ...
```

Thus drawing ship after clearing everything again. We need to remove that clearRect line and adjust ship drawing to use gradient. Also need to add gradient fill for ship, maybe radial or linear. Also enhance meteors (add inner shading) and orbs (glow). Let's edit.

We'll replace part from `// Ship – simple triangle with gradient` down to before `// Meteors` with gradient fill and keep ship shape. Also remove duplicate clearRect line.

